1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I majored in sociology and will soon begin graduate school.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,933
I wanted an approachable, subscription-free statistics tool—

3
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,900
and I want other students to have that same ease.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,867
That idea became Modori.

5
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:15,200
Here is the payoff:

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,000
649 released student records reach a reviewable Spearman result

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,733
and an editable report.

8
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:23,700
Method, coefficient, p-value,

9
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,800
sample size, and exclusions stay visible.

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:28,933
Now the path.

11
00:00:28,933 --> 00:00:32,133
I open a six-variable, non-identifying view,

12
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:34,333
review the labeled thirty-row preview,

13
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:37,467
then load all 649 records.

14
00:00:37,467 --> 00:00:40,267
The data stays on this computer.

15
00:00:40,267 --> 00:00:44,000
Before any method appears, Modori asks what the variables mean.

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,867
Study time is ordinal;

17
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:47,667
final grade is scale.

18
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:49,567
Labels, value codes,

19
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:53,033
missing rules, and storage type are reviewed first.

20
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:55,033
I begin with the research task:

21
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:57,667
do study time and grades move together?

22
00:00:57,667 --> 00:00:59,700
I assign exact roles.

23
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:03,167
Modori then asks bounded questions about clustering, dependence,

24
00:01:03,167 --> 00:01:06,100
and weights instead of guessing.

25
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,700
The candidate is Spearman correlation.

26
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:12,333
Its association-only claim, experimental status,

27
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:14,600
variables, missing-data policy,

28
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,067
and exact parameters remain visible.

29
00:01:17,067 --> 00:01:20,467
Nothing is silently selected or run.

30
00:01:20,467 --> 00:01:24,600
Prepare exposes the configuration and keeps the result empty.

31
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:27,867
Confirmation authorizes without calculating.

32
00:01:27,867 --> 00:01:32,400
Only the separate Run produces rho zero point two seven five,

33
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:35,600
with p below point zero zero one.

34
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:40,100
For a causal-effect request, Modori gives a clear scope decision.

35
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:44,800
It records the request instead of substituting a convenient analysis.

36
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:47,833
Abstention is a product behavior.

37
00:01:47,833 --> 00:01:50,767
With Codex and GPT-5.6,

38
00:01:50,767 --> 00:01:53,433
I turned product decisions into contracts,

39
00:01:53,433 --> 00:01:57,867
failing tests, implementation, and packaged-app verification.

40
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:01,233
That collaboration established the Variable Meaning Gate,

41
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:03,267
passport-and-ledger authority,

42
00:02:03,267 --> 00:02:06,900
and separate Prepare, Confirm, and Run boundaries.

43
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,933
That loop also closed real interface failures:

44
00:02:09,933 --> 00:02:13,533
recovering a workbook whose first sheet held no data,

45
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:16,600
protecting an existing report during replacement,

46
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:21,433
and replacing a generic failure card with an actionable recovery path.

47
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:24,867
Seven Royal Blue interface commits were integrated path by path

48
00:02:24,867 --> 00:02:27,633
across the existing codebase.

49
00:02:27,633 --> 00:02:29,600
The source suite passed,

50
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:32,867
while external reference checks supported calculation

51
00:02:32,867 --> 00:02:35,800
separately from recommendation boundaries.

52
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:39,500
Modori turns a research question into a reviewable path,

53
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:42,500
then leaves the final action to the researcher.

54
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,967
Kindness is not decoration.

55
00:02:44,967 --> 00:02:47,167
It is system behavior.
